  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- {前向|まえむ}きに{考|かんが}える (to think positively)\n- {前向|まえむ}きな{姿勢|しせい} (positive attitude)\n- {前向|まえむ}きに{検討|けんとう}する (to consider favorably)\n- {前向|まえむ}きに{取|と}り{組|く}む (to tackle proactively)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {後|うし}ろ{向|む}き (negative, backward-looking)\n\nNOTE: {前向|まえむ}きに{検討|けんとう}します is a common business phrase that often means \"we will think about it\" without guaranteeing action.",
